e.claude.com/docs/en/whats-new/2026-w14\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-03-30\",\n    \"community_feedback\": [\n      {\n        \"source\": \"Blog\",\n        \"sourceUrl\": \"https://alex000kim.com/posts/2026-03-31-claude-code-source-leak\",\n        \"quote\": \"accidentally shipping your source map to npm is the kind of mistake that sounds impossible until you remember that a lot of the codebase was probably written by the AI you are shipping\",\n        \"sentiment\": \"negative\",\n        \"date\": \"2026-03-31\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"GitHub Copilot\",\n    \"title\": \"Copilot SDK Public Preview\",\n    \"description\": \"GitHub Copilot SDK entered public preview, allowing developers to build custom integrations and extend Copilot capabilities.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"announcement\",\n    \"url\": \"https://github.blog/changelog\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-04-02\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"Cursor\",\n    \"title\": \"Background Agents in Slack Integration\",\n    \"description\": \"Cursor now supports launching Background Agents directly from Slack by mentioning @Cursor, enabling AI-powered workflows within team communication channels.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"feature\",\n    \"url\": \"https://cursor.sh/changelog\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-04-01\",\n    \"community_feedback\": [\n      {\n        \"source\": \"Medium\",\n        \"sourceUrl\": \"https://medium.com/@han.heloir/cursor-3-is-not-an-ide-update-its-a-bet-that-youll-manage-agents-not-write-code-0d2bc51f0dcb\",\n        \"quote\": \"Thirty minutes after the Cursor 3 announcement hit Hacker News, the top comment wasn't about a feature. It was a plea. 'I wish they'd keep the old philosophy of letting the developer drive and the agent assist,' one user wrote. 'I still want to _code_, not vibe my way through tickets.'\",\n        \"sentiment\": \"negative\",\n        \"date\": \"2026-04-03\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"Cursor\",\n    \"title\": \"BugBot: Automatic PR Review Agent\",\n    \"description\": \"BugBot provides automated pull request review capabilities, identifying issues and suggesting fixes before merge.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"feature\",\n    \"url\": \"https://cursor.sh/changelog\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-04-01\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"Cursor\",\n    \"title\": \"One-Click MCP Server Installation\",\n    \"description\": \"Simplified installation process for MCP (Model Context Protocol) servers with a single click, reducing setup complexity for external tool integrations.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"feature\",\n    \"url\": \"https://cursor.sh/changelog\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-04-01\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"Cursor\",\n    \"title\": \"Jupyter Notebook Support\",\n    \"description\": \"Added support for Jupyter Notebook files with enhanced editing and AI assistance capabilities for data science workflows.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"feature\",\n    \"url\": \"https://cursor.sh/changelog\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-04-01\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"Cursor\",\n    \"title\": \"Memories Feature: Context Persistence\",\n    \"description\": \"Memories feature allows Cursor to remember important project context and user preferences across sessions for more personalized assistance.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"feature\",\n    \"url\": \"https://cursor.sh/changelog\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-04-01\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"Cursor\",\n    \"title\": \"Unified Request-Based Pricing Model\",\n    \"description\": \"Cursor simplified pricing to a unified request-based model, replacing previous complex tier structures.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"announcement\",\n    \"url\": \"https://cursor.sh/changelog\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-04-01\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"Continue\",\n    \"title\": \"Version 1.3.38-vscode: Config Fixes and Workspace Filtering\",\n    \"description\": \"Continue v1.3.38-vscode includes config.yaml fixes, workspace directory filtering capabilities, and support for .continue/configs directory structure.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"release\",\n    \"url\": \"https://github.com/continuedev/continue/releases\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-04-04\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"Aider\",\n    \"title\": \"Version 0.56.0: Prompt Caching and Report Command\",\n    \"description\": \"Aider v0.56.0 introduces prompt caching for Sonnet via OpenRouter for improved performance, new /report command for session summaries, and --chat-language switch for multi-language support.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"release\",\n    \"url\": \"https://github.com/paul-gauthier/aider/releases\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-04-05\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"GitHub Copilot\",\n    \"title\": \"Copilot CLI BYOK and Local Model Support\",\n    \"description\": \"GitHub Copilot CLI now supports Bring Your Own Key (BYOK) and local model configurations, giving enterprises more control over their AI deployments.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"feature\",\n    \"url\": \"https://github.blog/changelog\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-04-07\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"GitHub Copilot\",\n    \"title\": \"Copilot Cloud Agent Validation Tools 20% Faster\",\n    \"description\": \"Validation tools in Copilot's cloud agent have been optimized to run 20% faster, improving response times for code review and validation tasks.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"feature\",\n    \"url\": \"https://github.blog/changelog\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-04-08\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"GitHub Copilot\",\n    \"title\": \"Copilot CLI Activity in Usage Metrics\",\n    \"description\": \"Copilot CLI usage is now included in organization usage metrics, providing better visibility into CLI-based AI assistant usage.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"feature\",\n    \"url\": \"https://github.blog/changelog\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-04-10\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"Codex CLI\",\n    \"title\": \"Version 0.120.0: Realtime V2 Background Agent Streaming\",\n    \"description\": \"Codex CLI v0.120.0 (April 11, 2026) introduces Realtime V2 background agent streaming, custom TUI status lines, and code-mode tool declarations with MCP outputSchema support.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"release\",\n    \"url\": \"https://developers.openai.com/codex/changelog\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-04-11\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"Windsurf\",\n    \"title\": \"Version 1.9600.38: Adaptive Model for Dynamic Selection\",\n    \"description\": \"Introduced Adaptive Model feature that dynamically selects the most appropriate AI model based on task complexity and context.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"feature\",\n    \"url\": \"https://windsurf.com/changelog\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-04-06\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"Windsurf\",\n    \"title\": \"Version 1.9600.40: GPT-5.4 Mini Integration\",\n    \"description\": \"Added GPT-5.4 mini model support for faster, more efficient code completion and generation tasks.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"release\",\n    \"url\": \"https://windsurf.com/changelog\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-04-06\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"Windsurf\",\n    \"title\": \"Version 1.9600.41: Adaptive Model Router\",\n    \"description\": \"Windsurf 1.9600.41 introduces adaptive model router for intelligent task routing to optimal models, plus GPT-5.4 mini integration and various model updates.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"release\",\n    \"url\": \"https://windsurf.com/changelog\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-04-07\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  }\n]",
